| F | healthy toolchain, **`go list` fails mid-listing** | **2** | `guard: go list ./... failed; cannot validate the Linux exclusion` — the partial set never reaches `go test` |
| G | native host, **relative `GO=go`** | **2** | `GO must be an absolute path (see §5.0); got: go` |
| H | absolute `GO`, but it reports **`go1.25.1`** | **2** | `toolchain: expected go1.25.5, got: go version go1.25.1 darwin/arm64` |
