E and I are the only exit-0 rows, and both are cases that *should* pass. **F, G and H are the three
ways revision 3 could produce a green gate over a wrong or partial input; all three now exit 2.**
Note that in case I the version and `GOROOT` assertions still ran and still had to pass — the
